  "id": "indirect-measurement",
  "term": "indirect measurement",
  "definition": "Indirect measurement is the estimation of a mental state or process from related observable data instead of assessing it directly. In this source, it refers to modeling cognitive load from dance posture and movement patterns rather than relying on subjective judgment alone.",
